students in understanding course material, develop effective study skills, and prepare for exams and quizzes. Work closely with faculty to understand course content and identify students needing extra help. Provide feedback on common academic challenges. Qualifications: Students with strong academic performance in the course(s) to be tutored, with faculty recommendation. Excellent communication skills and ability to explain complex concepts. ability to work independently and collaborate with faculty. Share Apply Apply for this position Required * First Name * Last Name * Email Address * Phone * Resume * We've received your resume. Click here to update it. Attach resume or Paste resume Attach resume as .pdf, .doc, .docx, .odt, .txt, or .rtf (limit 5MB) or Paste resume Paste your resume here or Attach resume file Cover Letter * Earliest start date? Can you work evenings? No answer Yes No Does your Financial Aid package include Federal Work Study? * -- No answer -- Yes No I don't know Human Check * Submit Application This website uses cookies and other analytics technologies. By selecting \"Allow\", you consent to the recording, use and sharing of your website activity by this website and its service providers. Allow Reject All Powered by"
