      "title": "Available Position (Company name withheld)",
      "description": "Students at FPU Only: INBRE Student Researcher Manchester NH - Career Page Skip To Job Description View All Jobs Available Position (Company name withheld) Students at FPU Only: INBRE Student Researcher Manchester NH Manchester, NH Seasonal College of Health and Natural Sciences Student (College) Share Job Summary: As part of Institutional Development Award (IDeA) Grant project entitled, “A Community Based High Intensity Interval Training Exercise Effects on Cardiovascular Health and Autonomic Function in Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus”, the Department of Doctor of Physical Therapy, Franklin Pierce University are seeking productive and motivated research assistant. What You’ll Do • Assists with recruitment and screening of study participants • Assist with keeping the modality and research instruments clean • Co-ordinate with community YMCA partners for exercise session scheduling • Assist blood pressure assessment and Heart Rate data collection • Assist with documentation and data entry • Assist exercise prescription and submaximal exercise test Experience and Qualifications: • A student in good professional behavior and academic standing maintaining at least a 3.5 cumulative GPA. Interested students should not have any history of academic probation or other professional behavior record action from the university. • Willing to work 5 hours a week (mostly at YMCA and few hours on DPT NH campus) • Clear communication with research participants, YMCA partners, and faculty • Willing to be posted for first clinicals within surrounding places and travel for work Special Notes: • Apply for RA position by mid-to-late June • Interview in June • Position will be offered during Term 4 • Once the position is confirmed, students need to have paperwork and training prior to being completely enrolled into the position Schedule: Terms IV (Summer 2026) and/or Fall/Winter 2026/2027 Wednesday and Friday, 5 hours per week. Share Apply Apply for this position Required * 