    "https://franklinpierceuniversity.applytojob.com/apply/xVxhpqA1l0/Students-Only-At-FPU-Content-Ambassador": {
      "title": "Students Only at FPU:  Content Ambassador",
      "description": "Students Only at FPU:  Content Ambassador - Franklin Pierce University - Career Page Skip To Job Description View All Jobs View Our Website Welcome to the Franklin Pierce University Job Board. We post all Faculty, Staff, Student Employment, and Graduate Assistant positions on this site. If you are looking for a collaborative environment where you have the ability to influence the student and workplace experience every day and where the contributions of a diverse group of individuals are highly valued, come see what we have to offer. We offer a competitive benefits package. Click here to review our Benefits Guide. As an Equal Opportunity employer, Franklin Pierce recognizes the impact of a diverse community and encourages applications from individuals with varied experiences, backgrounds and perspectives. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, national origin, pregnancy, age, disability gender identity and expression, protected veteran status or any other status protected by law. If you are unable to submit an application because of incompatible assistive technology or a disability, please contact us at [email protected] or 603-899-4075. We will make every effort to respond to your request for disability assistance as soon as possible. Students Only at FPU:  Content Ambassador Rindge, NH Part Time Franklin Pierce University Student (College) Share About the Role Are you passionate about your Franklin Pierce experience and ready to help future Ravens find their place here? Join our team as a Content Ambassador. You’ll connect with prospective students through one-on-one chats and group communities on various platforms. This includes our new engagement tool, Unibuddy, which helps to welcome incoming students. You will offer real, relatable insights into college life from your unique perspective. Responsibilities Engage in one-on-one chats with prospective students via our Unibuddy platform Participate in Unibuddy Community group discussions by welcoming new members, answering questions, and helping conversations flow Share your experiences with academics, campus life, housing, dining, student organizations, and other aspects of life at Franklin Pierce Represent your major, interests, and activities in a genuine and approachable way Support the team by helping plan and develop content that encourages student engagement Post regularly in Unibuddy groups, ideally 3-7 posts per week per student Monitor group activity and help maintain a positive and welcoming environment Help build a welcoming, inclusive digital space for all future students Represent the spirit & values of our community in a friendly, welcoming way This position will have a paid training period in late August/ early September Software tools will be provided: Unibuddy login, FPU-provided software, Ability to work over academic breaks. Qualifications: Be a current Franklin Pierce University undergraduate student Enthusiastic, dependable, and eager to help others Strong written and verbal communication skills Organized and creative, with good attention to detail Access to a mobile phone and computer Share Apply Apply for this position Required * First Name * Last Name * Email Address * Phone * Resume We've received your resume. Click here to update it. Attach resume or Paste resume Attach resume as .pdf, .doc, .docx, .odt, .txt, or .rtf (limit 5MB) or Paste resume Paste your resume here or Attach resume file What's your major? * Which campus activities are you active in? * Do you have any related experience with content development or social media you'd like to share? * Human Check * Submit Application This website uses cookies and other analytics technologies. By selecting \"Allow\", you consent to the recording, use and sharing of your website activity by this website and its service providers. Allow Reject All Powered by"
